# HUMANFILE — @{USERNAME} ({OPERATOR})
#
# Your identity, secrets, and autonomy grants.
# Created by `ostk init` from the os-tack/ostk.ai governance bail.
#
# Docs: https://ostk.ai/docs/humanfile

IDENTITY {USERNAME}
SIGN {GPG_KEY}

# Default model. Change to any of:
#   claude-opus-4-7         — strongest, slower, 1M context
#   claude-sonnet-4-6       — balanced (this default)
#   claude-haiku-4-5        — fastest, cheapest
#   google/gemini-3-flash-preview
#   google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview
MODEL claude-sonnet-4-6

# Provider secrets. Read from the operator's env, never committed.
SECRET <<KEYS
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
GOOGLE_API_KEY
OPENAI_API_KEY
KEYS

# Drivers — context-aware capability providers loaded at boot.
#   fcp-rust    Rust-aware code chunker and search
#   fcp-screen  TUI display driver
#   fcp-web     Web fetch + readability extraction
#   fcp-recall  Hybrid dense+BM25 retrieval over local corpus
DRIVER fcp-rust
DRIVER fcp-screen
DRIVER fcp-web
DRIVER fcp-recall
